&lt;h1&gt;About the Reconciliation team&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ripple Treasury Reconciliation platform sits at the heart of how the world&#39;s largest financial institutions and enterprises close their books and bring more control to their financial processes. Our vision is to create a completely new user experience with financial tools that have no equals on the market. With users first in mind and driven by technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of Ripple, we&#39;re backed by the scale and ambition of a company reshaping global finance, giving our team the resources to modernize the mission-critical product while still moving with the speed and ownership of a smaller engineering group. If you want your code to directly touch how billions of transactions get reconciled every day, this is that kind of role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
